# CDK TypeScript

- TypeScript only. Do not add Python/Java/C# CDK.
- Use AWS CDK v2 (`aws-cdk-lib`).
- Keep the main GameDay resources in one stack (`GamedayStack`); separate concerns with constructs under `lib/constructs/`. `GameDay-Legacy` is the only intentional extra stack (different deploy lifecycle).
- Prefer interface types (`ICluster`, etc.) for public props.
- Construct IDs must not end with `Stack` suffix (awscdk-lint).
- After construct changes, update Vitest tests (`pnpm test`).
